<td width="69%" bgcolor="#F0AA00"><font color="000000"><b>WOWOWO an update!</b></font></td>
<td width="1%" bgcolor="#000000">&nbsp;</td>
<td width="30%" bgcolor="#F0AA00"><font color="000000"><b>15.10.2001</b></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
          <td colspan=3> Ok, lets try to jam months of news into a single update shall we.<p>
Gorenaire died.  Absolutely no clue who got what from this.
<p>
<img src="http://home.earthlink.net/~cacruz25/_uimages/Gore1.jpg">
<p>
We also fed some useless CoV faction quest dragon a nome snack, which gave it a bad case of indigestion, making it easy prey!
<p>
<img src="http://home.earthlink.net/~cacruz25/_uimages/nomesnack.jpg">
<p>
Moving right along on our quest to become KoS to every dragon in the game, Severilious (do not hold me to that spelling :( ) got sniped a few times, producing green scales for Pett, Balladar, Slinkey and possibly more people.  Congrats to Pett and Balladar on their epics.
<p>
<img src="http://home.earthlink.net/~cacruz25/_uimages/sev.jpg">
<p>
While im updating stuff, I would like to congratulate Namahs on becoming our second Immortal Game Master! GG!
<p>
<img src="http://home.earthlink.net/~cacruz25/_uimages/Namahs.jpg">
<p>
Lastly, since epic spam is a required feature of any and all of our bi-yearly updates, I would like to congratulate Yaldaren, Suffer, Llolita, Yvonne, Kemien, Sildyar, Ooga, Aurelius, Aadinea, Qanya, Daeron and Tandidar on their epics!
<p>
Thats it for now.  I promise when I update the page next year, I shall have more interesting screenshots :D
<p>
-Jweez</td>
